---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const works = [
  { title: "校园 / Campus", source: "相机组投稿", cls: "visual-campus" },
  { title: "人物 / Portrait", source: "相机组投稿", cls: "visual-portrait" },
  { title: "春日 / Spring", source: "手机组投稿", cls: "visual-flower" },
  { title: "城市 / City", source: "相机组投稿", cls: "visual-city" },
  { title: "夜色 / Night", source: "手机组投稿", cls: "visual-night" },
  { title: "日常 / Everyday", source: "胶片组投稿", cls: "visual-film" },
];
---
<BaseLayout title="作品 · SCU LENS" active="/gallery">
  <div class="page-shell">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">Selected Works</div>
      <h1 class="display">作品</h1>
      <p>从 QQ 频道持续发生的投稿中，挑选适合长期留存的照片。作品页不是消息流，而是一座会慢慢长大的线上摄影档案。</p>
    </section>

    <section class="filter-bar" aria-label="作品筛选">
      <button class="filter-chip active" type="button">全部</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" type="button">校园</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" type="button">人物</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" type="button">城市</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" type="button">纪实</button>
      <button class="filter-chip" type="button">自然</button>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="gallery-grid">
        {works.map((work, i) => (
          <article class:list={["photo-card", "photo-" + (i + 1)]}>
            <div class:list={["photo-visual", work.cls]}></div>
            <div class="photo-caption">
              <div><h2>{work.title}</h2><p>主题作品</p></div>
              <span>{work.source}</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section gallery-source">
      <div class="eyebrow">Source</div>
      <p>作品按主题与内容组织；相机组、手机组与胶片组只作为投稿来源标注，不再决定作品所属分类。</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/submit">前往投稿专区 <span>↗</span></a>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
